paragraph\" >In the unique <strong>Linear Garbage</strong> system, Blocks matched will be sent to the opponent\u2019s grid in the same rows they were matched in. Skilled players may be able to make multiple matches in the same area to really stack up the punishment. So, pay close attention to the warning lights between the two grids, and try to keep your Blocks from piling up in one place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These matches can get fast. Keep your eyes on that metronome in the center and keep up with the pace as it gets faster and faster!\u00a0And if it's too much to handle, try adding some <strong>Extra Boards</strong>\u00a0to give both players another chance when their grid fills up!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187360/extras/79a42ce78d7b96f458032d8d31c3aae9.poster.avif?t=1752538251\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187360/extras/79a42ce78d7b96f458032d8d31c3aae9.webm?t=1752538251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187360/extras/79a42ce78d7b96f458032d8d31c3aae9.mp4?t=1752538251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong> (1 player), experience the latest season of daytime game show Ad Blocker: Commercial Chaos. In it, the stars of commercials new and old face off for the grand prize: the chance to wish for anything their heart desires! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring the faces of commercials such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magi-Gro: <i>The plant food that makes your garden grow like magic!</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosemary Road: <i>Where little monsters learn to be smart, kind, and always curious!</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cowboyonicle: <i>The legend of six brave cowboys in a time before time\u2026</i> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Quick Match</strong> (0-2 players), face off against your favorite Player 2, challenge the CPU at your own pace, or sit back and spectate a match between 2 CPU players.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game speed and CPU difficulty are customizable, so players can freely choose to have a relaxed bout, an intense 1v1, or anything in between!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Let's block some ads! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187360/extras/1bfa2d44dc54c79c1cee781109c7e594.poster.avif?t=1752538251\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187360/extras/1bfa2d44dc54c79c1cee781109c7e594.apng?t=1752538251\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span>*This is a work of fiction. All similarities to real people or events are purely coincidental. However, all similarities to real commercials are fully intentional and should be treated as (tasteful) parody. This game is not made in collaboration with or as promotion for any of the brands being parodied.</p>",
